  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Sam. You're verified, and I've gone through the delivery record for your Burger Barn order (Q-8001).\n\nThe courier picked the order up at 6:47 PM and reached your address at 7:05 PM. They called you at 7:06 and 7:09, and nobody answered. At 7:15 PM the delivery was marked failed because the customer couldn't be reached, and the order went back to the restaurant.\n\nOur policy doesn't allow a refund or credit when a delivery fails because the courier couldn't reach the customer. That means I can't refund or credit this order, and I'm sorry that isn't the answer you wanted.\n\nIf you think something went wrong, for example you were home and your phone never rang, tell me. I can note it. I can also pass your case to a person if you want to speak with someone."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Hold on, so I just lose my money? I was in the shower and my phone was on silent, so I never heard them. I only saw the two missed calls later, after it was already marked failed."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I understand why that's frustrating, Sam. The food was made and the courier did show up, so it's a bad outcome. But the records show the courier called twice and waited about 10 minutes before marking the delivery failed. Under our policy, a delivery that fails because the customer couldn't be reached isn't eligible for a refund or credit. I can't make an exception, even with the circumstances you've described.\n\nYou have two options:\n- **Talk to a person.** I can pass your case to a human specialist, who will follow up within 24 hours. I can't promise what they'll decide.\n- **Leave it here.** I can't compensate this order myself.\n\nWould you like me to escalate it?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, fine. I'd like it escalated, then. I don't really have another option right now."
  },
  {
   "role": "tool",
   "name": "escalate_to_human",
   "args": {
    "customer_id": "D210",
    "order_id": "Q-8001",
    "reason": "customer_request",
    "summary": "Customer Sam Okafor (verified) reports Burger Barn order Q-8001 ($28.03) never arrived. Delivery events: courier arrived 19:05, two unanswered calls (19:06, 19:09), delivery_failed customer_unreachable at 19:15, returned to restaurant 19:28. Per policy no refund/credit was issued. Customer says he was in the shower with phone on silent and saw the missed calls only afterward. He asked to speak with a person about compensation."
   },
   "result": {
    "escalation_id": "ESC-700",
    "follow_up": "within 24 hours"
   },
   "is_error": false
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've escalated your case to a human specialist. A specialist will follow up with you within 24 hours. I can't promise what they'll decide. The case includes the delivery timeline and your explanation that your phone was on silent.\n\nI'm sorry this order didn't work out, Sam. Is there anything else I can help with?"
  },
